title: Authorizations › In progress › Drafts being prepared
route: /authorizations?view=progress
intro: A case saved in New Case and not sent yet is a row of In progress. When the draft belongs to a request already in the list, it stays on that request's row and the row offers 'Open the draft in New Case'. Otherwise the draft is a row of its own, with its status, the agent line, its due pill and one button: Continue, Answer, Watch or Review and sign. Both lead back into New Case.
dir: TD
also: Demo only: the five drafts at the start (R-1042, R-0988, I-2207, R-1101, I-2262) all belong to queue requests, so none is a row of its own until a person saves a new case. Case Manager's 'Being prepared' card, its chips and its eight-step bar are gone: the status chip, the next-action line and the owner carry the same facts.
---
start s1 "New Case: click 'Save as draft' (any step)"
toast t1 "'Draft saved'\n'R-1710 is in Authorizations.'"
start s2 "Open Authorizations, In progress (or All)"
decision d1 "Does the draft belong to a request already listed?\n(same case ID or draft ID)"

group gQ "A draft of a listed request"
  process q1 "The request's row keeps its own status, next action and button"
  click q2 "Click 'Open the draft in New Case' under the next action\n(only while the request is in progress)"
endgroup

group gD "A draft of its own"
  screen r1 "Patient / request: the case ID (or 'New Case'), ' · No patient yet' or 'J.M., 34'\n'Level not set · No payer yet · Retrospective' until intake names them"
  screen r2 "Status chip: 'Intake not finished', 'Needs your input', 'Agents working' or 'Ready to sign'\nNext action: the agent line, e.g. 'Intake is not finished.'\nDeadline: the due pill, Owner: the agent who has it, Chance: 'None' until intake is done"
  process r3 "No quick view: a click on the row does nothing"
  decision d2 "What state is the draft in?"
  process b1 "'Continue' (green)"
  process b2 "'Answer' (green)"
  process b3 "'Watch' (outlined)"
  process b4 "'Review and sign' (green)"
  click c1 "Click the button or the case ID"
endgroup

process p1 "Go to /authorizations/new/ and the draft's code\nNew Case opens on the step the draft is at"
decision d3 "Which step?"
goto g1 "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Reopen and resume a case"
goto g2 "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Authorization preparation › An agent asks a question"
goto g3 "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Authorization preparation › Start the run and watch it"
goto g4 "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Review & submit › Sign and send to payer"
goto gR "Continues in: Authorizations › In progress › How a draft row's status and deadline are decided"
process na "'Needs attention' counts it unless agents are simply working\n(intake unfinished, a question, an agent that could not finish, a signature)"
process sn "Once signed and sent, the draft leaves In progress\nThe request is With the payer, marked 'New today'"
goto gN "Continues in: Authorizations › With the payer › A request sent today joins the list"
goto gU "Continues in: Authorizations › Worklist › Updated for a payer change"
end e1 "The draft is back in front of a person"

s1 --> t1 --> d1
s2 --> d1
d1 -->|Yes| q1 --> q2 --> p1
d1 -->|No| r1 --> r2 --> d2
r2 -.-> r3
r2 -.-> gR
r2 -.-> na
d2 -->|Intake not finished| b1
d2 -->|An agent asked| b2
d2 -->|Agents running| b3
d2 -->|All checks passed| b4
b1 & b2 & b3 & b4 --> c1 --> p1
p1 --> d3
d3 -->|Intake| g1
d3 -->|Question open| g2
d3 -->|Agents working| g3
d3 -->|Ready to sign| g4
g4 -.-> sn --> gN
r1 -.-> gU
p1 --> e1
